<title>FRANCE: PARIS BOURSE.</title>
<headline>PARIS BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paris CAC index was expected to start near to its previous close, sapped by thin volume, traders said.</p>
<p>Investors will be looking at Germany's budget being unveiled today, while there are concerns over the state of France's public finances.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 index closed down 21.47, or 0.73 percent, at 2,929.09.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 Jul futures 2,944 vs 2,931 at Thursdays close.</p>
<p>* Eurotunnel expected to requote higher after shareholders' vote overwhelming to back debt restructuring plan.</p>
</text>
